# Assessments

Before writing or revising anything under `docs/assessments/`, an options matrix, a
technology-selection doc or an ADR set, run
[`architecture-assessment-evidence`](../skills/architecture-assessment-evidence/SKILL.md).

## Forbidden

- A score cell justified by a vendor's documented behaviour rather than this system's
  configuration at a named commit, a verified PR state, or a dated measurement.
- Scoring how well a component is built before stating what it buys, at measured load, that the
  system would lose without it.
- Two documents or two scorecards in the set that disagree, or correction banners in presentation
  docs. History lives in the decisions doc and git.
